{"access_audiences": [], "access_type": "open", "access_type_reason": null, "access_type_reason_category": null, "acronym": null, "archived": null, "authorization_request_url": null, "badges": [], "contact_points": [{"contact_form": null, "email": null, "id": "67b7c288f5e65ba3abe260b0", "name": "Tours M\u00e9tropole Val de Loire", "organization": {"acronym": "TMVL", "badges": [{"kind": "local-authority"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5cb6d4f78b4c4118e18f37d1", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/27/4488cf622d40c78c73eeced9d14a3b.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/27/4488cf622d40c78c73eeced9d14a3b-100.png", "name": "Tours M\u00e9tropole Val de Loire", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/tours-metropole-val-de-loire", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "tours-metropole-val-de-loire", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/tours-metropole-val-de-loire/"}, "owner": null, "role": "publisher"}], "created_at": "2022-11-25T00:00:00+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Ce jeu de donn\u00e9e renseigne l'offre de transport th\u00e9orique (lignes, arr\u00eats, horaires) du r\u00e9seau Fil Bleu, ainsi que les donn\u00e9es temps r\u00e9el.\n\nLa donn\u00e9e th\u00e9orique est disponible sous le format GTFS (<https://gtfs.org/fr/schedule/>), elle est mise \u00e0 jour au maximum une fois par jour, et d\u00e9crit l\u2019offre th\u00e9orique pour les semaines/mois \u00e0 venir.\n\nLa donn\u00e9e temps r\u00e9el est disponible sous le format **GTFS-RT** (<https://gtfs.org/fr/realtime/>), et correspond aux donn\u00e9es actualis\u00e9es pour la journ\u00e9e courante J (entre J \u00e0 3h du matin et J+1 \u00e0 2h59). Le flux _vehicle-positions_ fournit la position en temps r\u00e9el des v\u00e9hicules. Le flux _trip-updates_ fournit les avance, retard et annulations de chaque trajet.\n\n* * *\n\nLe fichier _stops.txt_ contient la liste des arr\u00eats physiques et stations commerciales. Un arr\u00eat physique est rattach\u00e9 \u00e0 une station commerciale. Plusieurs arr\u00eats physiques peuvent \u00eatre rattach\u00e9s \u00e0 une station commerciale.\n\nExemple _(selon les donn\u00e9es du 01/01/2023)_ :\n\nLa station commerciale Vaucanson (StopArea : TTR:AC-LYVAB-1) est reli\u00e9e \u00e0 4 arr\u00eats physiques :\n\n  * StopPoint : TTR:LYVAB-1\n  * StopPoint : TTR:LYVAB-1A\n  * StopPoint : TTR:LYVAB-2\n  * StopPoint : TTR:LYVAB-2A", "description_short": null, "doi": null, "extras": {"dcat": {"license": ["https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/ETALAB-Licence-Ouverte-v2.0.pdf"], "rights": ["https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/ETALAB-Licence-Ouverte-v2.0.pdf"]}, "transport:url": "https://transport.data.gouv.fr/datasets/fil-bleu-syndicat-des-mobilites-gtfs-gtfs-rt"}, "featured": false, "frequency": "continuous", "frequency_date": null, "harvest": {"backend": "DCAT", "dct_identifier": "https://data.tours-metropole.fr/explore/dataset/horaires-temps-reel-gtfsrt-reseau-filbleu-tmvl/", "domain": "data.tours-metropole.fr", "issued_at": "2022-11-25T00:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-06T00:01:28.195000+00:00", "modified_at": "2026-10-05T12:21:16.440000+00:00", "remote_id": "https://data.tours-metropole.fr/explore/dataset/horaires-temps-reel-gtfsrt-reseau-filbleu-tmvl/", "remote_url": "https://data.tours-metropole.fr/explore/dataset/horaires-temps-reel-gtfsrt-reseau-filbleu-tmvl/", "source_id": "5e1735b36f44413ed3b87a30", "uri": "https://data.tours-metropole.fr/explore/dataset/horaires-temps-reel-gtfsrt-reseau-filbleu-tmvl/"}, "id": "638157af7f6b7cd00e2908e1", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2022-11-26T01:02:55.878000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-06-24T12:34:20.349000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-10-05T12:21:16.440000+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-05T12:21:16.440000+00:00", "license": "lov2", "metrics": {"dataserv